    "en": {
      "trackName": "Wrist Hero - Watch Games",
      "description": "Bored? Stressed? Just pop on your Apple Watch, flick your wrist, and boom! You're blasting lasers, torching stuff with flamethrowers, and unleashing insane special effects like some sci-fi action hero!\n\n【Gameplay Highlights】\nRaise your wrist to fire a blazing laser blast\nBottom-swing reload, realistic reloading\nSound and vibration feedback for double the impact\nFull gesture recognition with lightning‑fast response\n\n【Unlock Future Weapons】\nTECH REVOLVER\nClassic compact styling meets sci-fi punch\nTECH RIFLE\nHigh-speed burst fire with intense rhythm\nTECH SNIPER\nOne shot, one boom. Deadly precise and cool\nSONIC BLASTER\nEmits high-tech sonic pulses with weird energy\nTECH FLAMETHROWER\nRaise your wrist, whoosh! Flames burst to life\nCLASSIC REVOLVER\nSpin, click, and let the chaos begin\nDESERT EAGLE\nRealistic reload, raw explosive power\n\nWhether you’re bored at home, killing time outside or mid-convo with a friend, just raise your wrist.\nBoom! Time to flex like a sci-fi hero.",
